    <string name="onboarding_title_welcome">Welcome to Radio Diaspora</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_welcome">Live Kenyan radio wherever you are. Dozens of stations, free, and no account to create. Available in English and Kiswahili.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_find">Find your stations</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_find">Search by name, and tap the heart on any station to keep it under Favourites for one-tap access.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_listen">Listen anywhere</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_listen">Playback carries on in the background and from the lock screen, and you can cast any station to a Google Cast speaker or TV on your network. Tap the mini player at the bottom to open it full screen.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_record">Record what you hear</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_record">Tap record while a station is playing. Recordings are saved to Music/Radio Diaspora and open in any music app — as MP3 where the station broadcasts in MP3, with nothing re-encoded.</string>

    <string name="onboarding_title_agreement">User agreement</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_agreement">This app streams content that is publicly available from Kenyan radio broadcasters. We do not host or own that content; all rights belong to the respective owners. Anything you record is for your personal use only. This app is provided for personal, non-commercial use.</string>

